[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1981","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1981.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1042","title":"Mandrake Linux ypserv 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ypserv 是 Mandrake Linux 系统中 NIS（网络信息服务）的守护进程。Mandrake Linux 7.1 及更早版本中的 ypserv 在未使用 vsyslog() 函数编译时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 ypserv 发送特制网络请求触发该缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码，完全控制受影响的 Linux 系统。该漏洞也可能影响其他未使用 vsyslog() 函数编译的 Linux 发行版。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1042"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"升级到支持 vsyslog() 函数的 Mandrake Linux 8+ 版本，或应用官方 ypserv 安全补丁（如CVE-2000-1042修复程序），并确保 NIS 服务仅监听本地网络接口，同时禁用不必要的 NIS 映射查询功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-064.php3?dis=7.1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5730","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1042","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2000/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1042.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1042.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1042.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1981.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1980","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1980.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1041","title":"ypbind ypbind 3.3 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ypbind 3.3 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，运行于本地 root 权限下的 ypbind 服务在处理畸形或恶意输入数据时，未对缓冲区写入内容长度进行充分校验，触发越界写入（缓冲区溢出）。攻击者无需预先认证，可构造特制输入数据发送给目标，利用溢出覆盖内存中的关键数据和返回地址，劫持程序执行流程，最终可能获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 NIS 绑定服务的完整性与可用性，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。系统管理员应尽快升级至修复该漏洞的 ypbind 版本或禁用不必要的 NIS 服务以降低风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1041"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 ypbind 至 3.3 之后已修复该漏洞的版本；若无法升级，建议将该服务部署于内部可信网络，并在边界防火墙上限制对 834 端口（portmapper）及 ypbind 相关 RPC 服务的来源访问，仅允许受信任主机通过。同时按最小权限原则运行 ypbind 进程，避免其以 root 权限监听，并定期检查系统日志中与该服务相关的异常连接与异常请求，及时阻断可疑流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0262.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-039.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-064.php3?dis=7.1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5759","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1041","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2000/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1041.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1041.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1041.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1980.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1909","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1034","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 系统监视器 ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-1034是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1034"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS00-085 (KB278511) 修补 System Monitor ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出。补丁下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=19B2BF01-BA79-47D6-9372-79A9FFF9663B。若无法立即打补丁，可在 IE“Internet”安全区将“运行 ActiveX 控件和插件”设为“禁用”或“提示”，并在 Outlook/Outlook Express 中将 HTML 邮件置于“受限站点”区（安装 Outlook 安全更新可自动完成），同时遵循最小权限原则不以管理员身份运行日常操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349782305448&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1899","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-085","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5467","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1034.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1034.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1034.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1034","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1034.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1034.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1034.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1034.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c229a4a30cc18f066e828fa99f8fa314a2da50ed/2000/CVE-2000-1034.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1909.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1909.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1908","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1024","title":"eWave ServletExec 未授权文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>eWave ServletExec 3.0C 及更早版本存在权限许可不当漏洞，其 UploadServlet Java/JSP servlet 未对访问权限做任何限制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问该 servlet 并上传任意文件，包括恶意的 JSP 页面或可执行程序，进而利用上传的文件执行任意系统命令，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响部署 eWave ServletExec 3.0C 及以下版本的 Web 应用服务器，攻击条件极低，无需凭据即可利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1024"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 ServletExec 3.0E 版本，下载地址为 http://www.servletexec.com/downloads/，或联系 Unify 厂商（info@unify.com / 1-800-248-6439）获取补丁。如无法立即升级，可在 Apache 或 IIS 等前端 Web 服务器中通过访问控制列表限制对 /servlet/com.unify.ewave.servletexec.UploadServlet 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问，或直接删除该 servlet 类文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97306581513537&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1876","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5450","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1024","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b84ffe2a6a36d65b7abc48d8adad1e8aeabb391/2000/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1024.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1024.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1024.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1908.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1908.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1906","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1010","title":"OpenBSD talkd 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenBSD talkd 存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 talkd 服务发送包含格式化字符（如 %n、%s）的恶意用户名，触发格式化字符串漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 及其他基于 BSD 的操作系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1010"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"立即应用 OpenBSD 2.7 errata #026 提供的 talkd 源码补丁（https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.7/common/026_talkd.patch），或升级至 OpenBSD 2.8 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用 talkd 服务：编辑 /etc/inetd.conf，注释掉 talk 行后重启 inetd，或执行 `chmod 0 /usr/libexec/talkd` 移除执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/137890","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1764","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5344","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1010","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963310d0117c8de2c6908e6e4a8dba13966a88f4/2000/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1010.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1010.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1010.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1900","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0999","title":"OpenBSD SSH 程序格式字符串权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenBSD ssh 程序存在格式字符串漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 SSH 服务发送包含格式字符串特质的输入，利用服务端代码中未正确过滤用户输入的方式触发漏洞，从而覆盖栈内存或跳转执行流，最终获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 操作系统上的 ssh 程序及其他基于 BSD 的操作系统。由于 SSH 服务通常暴露在公网且无需预先认证，攻击条件极低，网络可达即可利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户升级 OpenBSD 至修复版本并重新编译 ssh 程序以消除漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0999"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"立即应用 OpenBSD 2.7 官方安全补丁 028_format_strings.patch，下载地址为 ftp://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.7/common/028_format_strings.patch。执行步骤如下：进入 /usr/src 目录，运行 patch -p0 < 028_format_strings.patch 应用补丁；随后依次重新编译并安装受影响的程序：cd usr.bin/fstat && make depend && make && make install；cd ../passwd && make depend && make && make install；cd ../top && make depend && make && make install；cd ../su && make depend && make && make install；cd ../ssh && make depend && make && make install。补丁通过将所有 printf 风格的函数调用中未加格式化说明符的字符串参数改为使用 \"%s\" 格式说明符（例如将 log(buf) 改为 log(\"%s\",buf)），修复了 ssh 等特权程序中的格式字符串漏洞，从而消除攻击者利用此漏洞获取 root 权限的风险。如无法立即打补丁，可通过防火墙或 TCP Wrappers 限制 SSH 远程访问作为临时缓解措施，仅允许受信任的 IP 地址连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-0999.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0999.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0999.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-0999.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0999.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0999","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0999.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0999.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0999.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0999.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1074","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1073","title":"Apple iCal 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>iCal 2.1 Patch 2 中的 csstart 程序在当前工作目录中搜索 cshttpd 程序时存在不安全的程序设计。本地攻击者可在某目录中创建名为 cshttpd 的特洛伊木马程序，并从该目录调用 csstart，从而执行恶意代码并获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响安装了 iCal 2.1 Patch 2 的系统，攻击条件为攻击者具备本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1073"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"升级到 iCal 2.1 Patch 3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 csstart 程序搜索 cshttpd 的路径遍历漏洞；若无法立即升级，可通过设置安全的 PATH 环境变量或移除当前工作目录的执行权限来防止特洛伊木马程序被执行；同时配置系统访问控制策略限制本地用户在可写目录中创建可执行文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100900-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7210","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1769","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5757","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1073","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f71e6da69aa54c2303f943ea4b05f52ce2f911ff/2000/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/79f011994331b34296ba6ea2a2efb2abebb8b5f6/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1073.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1073.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1073.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1073","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1070","title":"Poll It pollit.cgi 信息泄露漏洞","description":"标签中。<value>Poll It 2.01 及更早版本中的 pollit.cgi 脚本存在信息泄露漏洞。由于该脚本使用的数据文件被存储在 Web 服务器文档根目录下，未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何凭据即可直接通过 HTTP 请求访问这些文件，从而泄露应用程序的敏感配置数据或用户私有信息。该漏洞影响使用 Poll It 2.01 及之前版本的网站，攻击者只需构造针对 pollit.cgi 相关数据文件的 URL 即可读取敏感内容，造成信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1070"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"1. 将 pollit_files 目录从 Web 文档根目录迁移到 Web 无法直接访问的目录（如 /var/lib/pollit_files），并在 pollit.cgi 中修改 $poll_options 等变量指向新的绝对路径；2. 对数据文件设置 640 权限，确保 Web 服务器用户可读写但禁止外部直接访问；3. 如无法迁移文件，可在 Web 服务器配置中添加 <Files> 或 location 规则禁止直接访问 pollit_files 目录下的所有文件；4. 建议升级到 Poll It 后续版本，或替换为更安全的 CGI 投票程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236719315352&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5794","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1070","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2000/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/22b1a4be43e1ee76195d2510f5edf079a15013bd/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1070.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1070.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1070.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1073.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1073.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1072","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1066","title":"FreeBSD 操作系统 DNS getnameinfo 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 4.0、4.1 及 4.1.1 版本的 getnameinfo 函数在处理 DNS 主机名时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送超长的 DNS 主机名触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.1.1 及更早版本，并可能波及其他使用相似实现的 Unix-like 操作系统。攻击者无需身份认证，只需通过网络发送特制 DNS 响应或构造包含超长主机名的网络请求即可利用此漏洞，造成目标系统 DNS 解析功能瘫痪或进程崩溃。攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可致系统可用性下降，但无法获取敏感数据或提升权限。建议用户升级至 FreeBSD 后续安全版本以修复该问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1066"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"将受影响的 FreeBSD 4.0/4.1/4.1.1 系统升级至 FreeBSD 4.2-RELEASE 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，可从 FreeBSD 官方安全公告 FreeBSD-SA-00:63 下载 getnameinfo.patch，执行 cd /usr/src/lib/libc && patch -p < /path/to/patch && make depend && make all install 重新编译 libc 以修复 getnameinfo 函数的 off-by-one 错误。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1894","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5454","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1066","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2000/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1066.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1066.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1066.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1071","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1065","title":"惠普 Jetdirect 打印服务器 IP 实现拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP JetDirect 打印卡固件 IP 协议实现存在漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的畸形网络数据包触发该漏洞，导致打印机拒绝服务崩溃。该漏洞影响固件版本为 X.08.04、X.08.05 及 X.08.20 及更早版本的 HP JetDirect 打印卡，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络上任意发起利用，且攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者只需构造符合漏洞触发条件的畸形 IP 数据包并发送至目标打印卡的 IP 地址即可造成服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1065"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"升级 HP JetDirect 打印卡固件至厂商发布的最新版本。受影响版本包括 X.08.04、X.08.05 及 X.08.20 及更早版本，应访问 HP 官方支持网站下载并安装更新后的固件以修复 IP 实现中的畸形数据包处理漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界部署访问控制规则，限制对打印卡 IP 地址的未授权访问，以临时缓解拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97119729613778&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1775","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5354","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1065","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2000/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1065.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1065.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1065.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1070","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1064","title":"HP Jetdirect LPD 服务缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP JetDirect 打印卡固件 X.08.20 及更早版本（包括 X.08.04、X.08.05）的 LPD（Line Printer Daemon）打印服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标设备的 LPD 服务端口发送特制的恶意数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致打印服务崩溃或设备无响应，从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行受影响固件版本的 HP JetDirect 打印卡设备，攻击条件简单，无需用户交互或权限认证，利用门槛低，可直接影响企业办公环境中网络打印服务的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1064"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"下载并安装 HP Jetdirect 固件升级程序（http://www.hp.com/cposupport/networking/software/allhpjd3.exe.html），升级到至少 X.08.21 版本以修复 LPD 服务缓冲区溢出漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97119729613778&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1775","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5353","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1064","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2000/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1064.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1064.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1064.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1069","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1063","title":"HP Jetdirect 打印机网卡 Telnet 服务缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP JetDirect 打印卡 Telnet 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，固件版本 x.08.20 及更早版本（包括 x.08.04、x.08.05）均受影响。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可向目标设备 Telnet 服务（默认端口 23）发送超长或构造畸形的数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致打印卡服务异常中断，网络打印功能完全不可用，造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞攻击复杂度低、无需认证、无需用户交互，攻击者可远程发起利用，影响所有暴露 Telnet 服务的 HP JetDirect 打印服务器设备。HP 已发布固件更新修复此问题，建议用户升级到 x.08.20 之后的安全版本并限制 Telnet 服务的网络访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1063"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"升级 HP Jetdirect 打印卡固件至 x.08.20 之后的安全版本（建议通过 HP 官方支持渠道获取最新固件并重新刷写）；如无法立即升级，建议在设备管理界面禁用 Telnet、FTP 及 LPD 服务，并在网络边界通过防火墙或 ACL 限制对 Jetdirect 设备管理端口的访问，仅允许可信网段通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97119729613778&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1775","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5353","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1063","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2000/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1063.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1063.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1068","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1062","title":"惠普 Jetdirect FTP 服务缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP JetDirect 打印卡固件 X.08.04、X.08.05 及 X.08.20 及更早版本中的 FTP 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 FTP 请求数据包触发该溢出，导致打印卡服务崩溃或重启，从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行上述受影响固件版本的 HP JetDirect 打印服务器及网络打印设备，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在网络可达的情况下直接利用，攻击条件简单，利用难度低，主要造成服务可用性中断而非数据泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1062"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"立即升级 HP Jetdirect 打印服务器固件至厂商发布的最新版本，修复 FTP 服务缓冲区溢出漏洞。升级固件可从 HP 官方支持网站下载对应型号的最新固件包并刷写。如暂无法升级，可在网管设备上通过防火墙或 ACL 规则阻断对 Jetdirect FTP 端口（TCP 21）的访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97119729613778&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1775","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5353","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1062","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2000/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1062.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1062.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1062.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1067","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1060","title":"XFCE xinitrc 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"XFCE 3.5.1 桌面环境默认配置存在权限提升漏洞。其 xinitrc 启动脚本中包含\"xhost + localhost\"命令，该命令绕过了 X Window 系统原有的 Xauthority 访问控制安全机制，导致本地主机上的所有用户均可未经身份验证直接连接到 X 服务器。此漏洞影响 XFCE 3.5.1 版本，攻击条件为攻击者需具备目标系统的本地访问权限（如已拥有本地shell账号），攻击复杂度低且无需额外认证。成功利用后，本地攻击者可通过嗅探 X Windows 会话流量获取敏感信息，并借此提升自身权限。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为 4.6，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成部分影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1060"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"建议将 XFCE 升级至 3.5.2 或更高版本，该版本已移除 xinitrc 中不安全的 xhost + localhost 默认配置并恢复 Xauthority 访问控制。如无法立即升级，可手动编辑 ~/.xinitrc 及 /etc/xinitrc，删除或注释掉 xhost + localhost 相关行，改用 xauth 生成并管理 X11 认证 cookie，并在启动 X 服务器时通过 -auth 参数指定安全认证文件，以阻止本地用户嗅探 X Windows 流量获取未授权访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0022.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1736","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5305","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1060","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2000/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1060.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1060.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1060.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1066","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1059","title":"Mandrake Linux Xsession 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Mandrake Linux 7.0 和 7.1 的 Xsession 文件默认配置使用 \"xhost + localhost\" 命令，该命令绕过了 Xauthority 访问控制机制的安全限制。攻击者利用此漏洞，可通过本地用户身份窃听 X Window 系统事件并获取提升的权限。该漏洞影响 Mandrake Linux 7.0 和 7.1 版本，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高。任何能够登录到目标系统的本地用户均可利用此漏洞，在无需额外身份验证的情况下提升权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1059"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Mandrake Linux 7.2 或更高版本，这些版本已修复 Xsession 配置文件中的 \"xhost + localhost\" 命令。如无法升级，手动编辑 /etc/X11/xinit/Xsession 文件，注释或删除包含 \"xhost + localhost\" 的行，并确保系统使用 xauth 和 ~/.Xauthority 文件进行 X11 访问控制。如暂时无法修改配置，可通过限制本地用户对 X11 显示器的访问权限或禁用不必要的 X11 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-052.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/136495","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1735","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5305","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1059","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b3f4c2d3415c65726be0117ea27f8235b2a3446a/2000/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1059.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1059.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1059.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1066.toml"}]